/E (Luna could not move. Her mother's last words from that forgotten memory kept repeating inside her head. Promise me you will never write my name. She looked at the black book on the desk as if it had suddenly become something alive. Until that moment, Luna had thought the book was a strange object that had somehow found her. Now she began to wonder if the book had been part of her family long before she ever knew it existed. )
