/E (Luna opened her eyes with a sharp breath. She was back in her bedroom, sitting on the floor beside her desk. The black book lay open in front of her, but the silver light was gone. The room looked exactly as it had before. Her lamp was still on. The rain had stopped. The photograph of Elara was still hanging on the wall. For a few seconds, Luna could not understand what had happened. She looked at her hands, then at the book, then at the photograph again. Her mother's voice was still clear inside her mind. Find Mira. )
