/S /P
/P 736 0 R
/E (Luna opened her eyes and found herself standing in the middle of a beautiful street. The sky was bright blue. Small white clouds moved slowly above the rooftops. Trees lined both sides of the road, and flowers grew everywhere. There were no broken buildings, no traffic, no noise. Everything looked peaceful. Luna turned around, searching for the library, her father, or the First Writer. There was nothing. Only the quiet street stretching in both directions. )
/Pg 88 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
