/Title (Mira moved her chair to make space for her. Elara looked at her daughter and smiled. Luna sat down between the people she loved. Her father passed her a plate. Mira started telling another story. Elara laughed. Luna laughed with them. And somewhere in the world, a black book waited for its next reader. Luna didn't know what her story would become tomorrow.)
/Dest [168 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
