/Title (But lately, she could not finish anything. For the past few months, every story she started ended on the same blank page. Luna closed her notebook. She leaned back in her chair. Outside, lightning flashed across the sky. For one short second, her room became bright.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 3480 0 R
/Next 4116 0 R
>>
endobj
3901 0 obj
<<
/Title (Because Luna had finally learned that not every story needed to be controlled. Some stories needed to be lived. Some pages needed to remain blank. Some endings needed to remain unknown. And some books were better left waiting. Luna opened the door to the dining room.)
/Dest [168 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4117 0 R
/Next 3481 0 R
>>
endobj
