/Title (Luna looked at the lives around her again. For the first time, she wasn't tempted by how beautiful they were. She was frightened by how easily she could disappear into them. She thought about Mira. She thought about Elara. She thought about all the previous writers whose lives were now trapped inside books. Then she remembered something her mother had once said.)
