/Title (She believed the book had given her what she wanted. But then she noticed something small. Luna had not even been born yet, but the world was already choosing things for her. Elara realized that if she continued, Luna would grow up inside a life written before she ever had the chance to make her own choices. Elara could protect Luna from sadness, but she could also take away Luna's freedom to face life for herself.)
